A '''Lotus Guardian''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished in [[Water]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Lotus Guardian''' can be fished up anywhere on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} once the player is {{skill|fishing|10}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for a '''Lotus Guardian''' is {{Green|2,875}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked.

